rem            "Check the shaders.bat", beside the builds, reads the tags on this computer
rem            and says which: no shader_model of that exact name (and which similar names
rem            do exist), a tag of that name that is empty because Tool made it when the
rem            name was missing, a base map pointing at a bitmap tag that is not there, or a
rem            model tag / .map built before the shaders were made - that last one keeps the
rem            empty reference it baked, however the tag looks now.
rem            Names are matched exactly, spaces and capitals: a tag called "face" does not
rem            answer "UNSC Marine Armor face". It writes nothing, and it needs the same
